{"about_the_game":"Arcade Artist is an experience that combines the unique exploration of a creative playground along with casual arcade activities that makes this VR experience perfect for all age groups. Think painting and creating on in a fantastic world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe team behind the Arcade Artist wanted to create a world that allows you to step into a fantastical place where you can IMAGINE, CREATE ART and CAUSE CHAOS.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith simple and intuitive tools, like the Laser Light Etcher, Velocity Brush, and Paintball Blaster Prototype #7, you can get lost. Players will be surprised and delighted on how much fun VR can be. Especially when they unlock hidden surprises within the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiscover the world of Arcade Artist. More to come!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a0fd027f729b111e8d2fea7614380764ec8957fa.jpg","localized_name":"Bouncing Paintballs","name":"Bouncing Paintballs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/534430/a0fd027f729b111e8d2fea7614380764ec8957fa.jpg"},{"icon":"5b44a1e8c8d85eacd168bb02815ba9c464cc4ce8.jpg","localized_name":"2X Paintball Speed","name":"2X Paintball Speed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/534430/5b44a1e8c8d85eacd168bb02815ba9c464cc4ce8.jpg"},{"icon":"878693999c32d59003cbc459a4cb73e3fc1e366b.jpg","localized_name":"Torch Lighter","name":"Torch Lighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/534430/878693999c32d59003cbc459a4cb73e3fc1e366b.jpg"},{"icon":"c6e808d51f421c46c507a99aca8478cf6587652d.jpg","localized_name":"Paintball Butterfly Doubler","name":"Paintball Butterfly Doubler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/534430/c6e808d51f421c46c507a99aca8478cf6587652d.jpg"},{"icon":"6250fb92556d507bd612fb7a65e930bced9781bd.jpg","localized_name":"Match 3","name":"Match 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi